kebab-tools is a collection of simple, fast, and 
lightweight utilities designed for developers 
and power users.

[ PHILOSOPHY ]
The web is bloated. kebab-tools aims to provide 
the essentials without the fluff. If it can't 
be used with a simple 'curl' command, it's 
probably too complicated.

[ FEATURES ]
- Terminal-first: Fast responses for CLI users.
- Browser-ready: Visual interface at /web.html.
- Minimalist: Zero tracking, zero ads.

[ SOURCE ]
Managed by kebabos. 
